        "body": "Dear Lila,${NL}Love the garden idea—I’ve been hoping for something like this on our block! The thought of fresh ${Q7} sounds delicious, and I think it’ll bring us all closer together. I’d go with crowdfunding—Q{8} seems practical since it spreads the cost evenly and gets everyone invested. One plot per household is fine—${Q9} keeps it fair, especially with limited space. I’d pick mid-June for the event—${Q10} works better for me because July’s already packed with travel plans. I can volunteer on the 25th—11 ${Q11} is doable, and I’m happy to pitch in with the weeding crew! Looking forward to seeing this take root.${NL}Cheers,${NL}Sam",
